{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31353","headline":"对酒 · 赵牧","name":"对酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云翁耕扶桑，种黍养日乌。\n手挼六十花甲子，循环落落如弄珠。\n长绳系日未是愚，有翁临镜捋白须。\n饥魂吊骨吟古书，冯唐八十无高车。\n人生如云在须臾，何乃自苦八尺躯。\n裂衣换酒且爲娱，劝君朝饮一瓢。\n夜饮一壶，杞天崩。\n雷腾腾，桀非尧是何足凭。\n桐君桂父岂胜我，醉里白龙多上昇。\n菖蒲花开鱼尾定，金丹始可延君命。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}